    "quote": "Manufacturers shall report every confirmed thermal incident involving overheating, smoke, fire, or thermal runaway to the regulator within 24 hours of becoming aware of it, including incidents involving injury, property damage, or a suspected product defect. Manufacturers shall notify affected customers within 72 hours when an incident indicates a potential hazard to their unit or requires action; urgent hazards require immediate notice."
   },
