    "quote": "Remote emergency shut-off shall be required on all newly manufactured home battery units beginning 36 months after adoption of this standard. Manufacturers shall retrofit already-installed units to support remote emergency shut-off within 6 years of adoption, where technically feasible, and shall provide customers with a clear schedule and instructions. Any exception or alternative protective measure shall require regulator approval."
   },
